  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>🌡️ Pixel Temp</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"decimal\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"output\">\n      <span class=\"output-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">--</output>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C→F: x × 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F→C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #1a1a2e;\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #16213e;\n  border: 4px solid #0f3460;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f3460;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: #e94560;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  border: 3px solid #1a1a2e;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: #e94560;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #e94560;\n}\n\ninput:hover, select:hover {\n  border-color: #533483;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 14px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  background: #e94560;\n  color: #fff;\n  border: 3px solid #0f3460;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0f3460;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ff5c77;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #533483;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 #0f3460;\n}\n\n.output {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: #0f3460;\n  border: 3px solid #1a1a2e;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.output-label {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #a0a0b0;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n#result {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: #e94560;\n}\n\n.formula {\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #666;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 24px 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 20px; }\n  #result { font-size: 24px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') {\n    resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const x = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(x)) {\n    resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let result;\n  if (directionSelect.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    result = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    result = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  resultEl.textContent = result.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\ntempInput.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    convert();\n  }\n});\n\ndirectionSelect.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    convert();\n  }\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA retro pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline — no packages, network requests, or external assets.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature value in the **Temperature** field.\n3. Choose a direction from the **Direction** dropdown:\n   - **Celsius → Fahrenheit**\n   - **Fahrenheit → Celsius**\n4. Click **Convert** (or press **Enter** in the input).\n5. The result appears in the **Result** output box, formatted to exactly two decimal places without units.\n\nIf the input is empty, non-numeric, or non-finite (e.g. `Infinity`, `NaN`), the output shows exactly `Error`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9 / 5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5 / 9`\n\n## Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `index.html` | Structure: labeled input, direction select, convert button, result output |\n| `style.css` | Pixel-themed styling, responsive layout, hover/focus/active states |\n| `script.js` | Conversion logic, validation, event listeners (no inline handlers) |\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have visible labels.\n- Full keyboard support: Tab to navigate, Enter to convert.\n- `aria-live=\"polite\"` on the result announces updates to screen readers.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No storage, cookies, or localStorage used.\n- No imports, packages, or network requests.\n- Layout works from 360px wide and up.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
